      "before": "<div class=\"callout note\"><p><b>Before this page:</b> <a href=\"{{BASE}}lld/lld-pat-composite\">Composite</a>, <a href=\"{{BASE}}lld/lld-pat-specification\">Specification</a>, <a href=\"{{BASE}}lld/lld-conc-rwlock\">Read-write locks</a>. Each is used here without being re-taught; a quick skim of each is enough.</p></div>"
